{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":29.899999618530273,"text":"Clay vases with animals in bands—wild goats, lions, birds, deer—one behind another like a procession. They are Rhodian, made in the 7th and 6th centuries B.C., when the island traded with Egypt and the East. You can see it in the designs. Some of the animals on them never lived on roads, and some never lived anywhere. The painters copied images that arrived on ships and mixed them with their own imagination.","words":[{"word":"Clay","start":0,"end":0.7400000095367432},{"word":"vases","start":0.7400000095367432,"end":1.1200000047683716},{"word":"with","start":1.1200000047683716,"end":1.6399999856948853},{"word":"animals","start":1.6399999856948853,"end":2.0999999046325684},{"word":"in","start":2.0999999046325684,"end":2.940000057220459},{"word":"bands—wild","start":2.940000057220459,"end":3.799999952316284},{"word":"goats","start":3.799999952316284,"end":4.199999809265137},{"word":"lions","start":5.139999866485596,"end":5.139999866485596},{"word":"birds","start":5.960000038146973,"end":5.960000038146973},{"word":"deer—one","start":6.679999828338623,"end":7.599999904632568},{"word":"behind","start":7.599999904632568,"end":8.0600004196167},{"word":"another","start":8.0600004196167,"end":8.460000038146973},{"word":"like","start":8.460000038146973,"end":8.739999771118164},{"word":"a","start":8.739999771118164,"end":9.039999961853027},{"word":"procession","start":9.039999961853027,"end":9.4399995803833},{"word":"They","start":10,"end":10.140000343322754},{"word":"are","start":10.140000343322754,"end":10.380000114440918},{"word":"Rhodian","start":10.380000114440918,"end":10.760000228881836},{"word":"made","start":11.279999732971191,"end":11.479999542236328},{"word":"in","start":11.479999542236328,"end":11.720000267028809},{"word":"the","start":11.720000267028809,"end":12.15999984741211},{"word":"7th","start":12.15999984741211,"end":12.220000267028809},{"word":"and","start":12.220000267028809,"e